<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - SCF TBN - 80,000 tonnes coal Mobile and Hampton Roads/Port Talbot $8.25 fio six days shinc 10-20/3 British Steel.</p>
<p>ORE - Concorde Spirit - 150,000 tonnes ore Port Hedland/Fos $8.40 fio 80,000 shinc/30,000 shinc end Apr BHP.</p>
<p>K Line TBN - 120,000 tonnes ore Tubarao or Punta da Madeira/Kaohsiung $9.70 option Sepetiba Bay $9.90 40,000 shinc/38,000 shinc 4-14/4 China Steel.</p>
